    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/1c5c29d07e743d246e189cb12ad38f72.poster.avif?t=1755187576\" width=800 height=66 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/1c5c29d07e743d246e189cb12ad38f72.webm?t=1755187576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/1c5c29d07e743d246e189cb12ad38f72.mp4?t=1755187576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Above the sun, a great rift is tearing apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Below the walls, enemies are breaking through like there\u2019s no resistance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the empire\u2019s warmaster, you have to travel back to where it all starts, trying to put an end of this amiss destiny.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lead Your Men-at-arms</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose and control various troops to fight by your side. Experience yourself in this immersive medieval-like fantasy battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/aab0cd9dcf48eec6e18167cbb9588a66.poster.avif?t=1755187576\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/aab0cd9dcf48eec6e18167cbb9588a66.webm?t=1755187576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/aab0cd9dcf48eec6e18167cbb9588a66.mp4?t=1755187576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical View</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slaughter the enemies with your own hand as the warmaster, or plan your troops precisely under Tactical view.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/1e9c16275e044bfc675a170cf5134821.poster.avif?t=1755187576\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/1e9c16275e044bfc675a170cf5134821.webm?t=1755187576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/1e9c16275e044bfc675a170cf5134821.mp4?t=1755187576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Warmaster Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance your warmaster with game progression. Unlock skills matching your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/a2cd35362dcc57d1b009e8ee292a17ac.poster.avif?t=1755187576\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/a2cd35362dcc57d1b009e8ee292a17ac.webm?t=1755187576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/a2cd35362dcc57d1b009e8ee292a17ac.mp4?t=1755187576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelite Builds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your regiment through perks\u00a0and select\u00a0random reinforcements\u00a0during each expedition. Achieve various playstyle by configuring your builds.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/e81a64bffcb119c70887471e79dfa574.avif?t=1755187576\" width=640 height=169 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Us</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are a small team that contains only 1 full-time dev and 3 part-time devs, and we really need community feedback to inprove our game. Join our Discord and talk to us!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/1c5c29d07e743d246e189cb12ad38f72.poster.avif?t=1755187576\" width=800 height=66 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/1c5c29d07e743d246e189cb12ad38f72.webm?t=1755187576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/1c5c29d07e743d246e189cb12ad38f72.mp4?t=1755187576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Above the sun, a great rift is tearing apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Below the walls, enemies are breaking through like there\u2019s no resistance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the empire\u2019s warmaster, you have to travel back to where it all starts, trying to put an end of this amiss destiny.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lead Your Men-at-arms</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose and control various troops to fight by your side. Experience yourself in this immersive medieval-like fantasy battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/aab0cd9dcf48eec6e18167cbb9588a66.poster.avif?t=1755187576\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/aab0cd9dcf48eec6e18167cbb9588a66.webm?t=1755187576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/aab0cd9dcf48eec6e18167cbb9588a66.mp4?t=1755187576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical View</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slaughter the enemies with your own hand as the warmaster, or plan your troops precisely under Tactical view.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/1e9c16275e044bfc675a170cf5134821.poster.avif?t=1755187576\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/1e9c16275e044bfc675a170cf5134821.webm?t=1755187576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/1e9c16275e044bfc675a170cf5134821.mp4?t=1755187576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Warmaster Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance your warmaster with game progression. Unlock skills matching your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/a2cd35362dcc57d1b009e8ee292a17ac.poster.avif?t=1755187576\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/a2cd35362dcc57d1b009e8ee292a17ac.webm?t=1755187576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/a2cd35362dcc57d1b009e8ee292a17ac.mp4?t=1755187576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelite Builds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your regiment through perks\u00a0and select\u00a0random reinforcements\u00a0during each expedition. Achieve various playstyle by configuring your builds.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/e81a64bffcb119c70887471e79dfa574.avif?t=1755187576\" width=640 height=169 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Us</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are a small team that contains only 1 full-time dev and 3 part-time devs, and we really need community feedback to inprove our game. Join our Discord and talk to us!</p>",
    "short_description": "This is a strategy action war game set in a fictional fantasy world. You play as a warmaster, commanding troops in battles. Use the roguelike system to customize your gameplay style: will you be a one-man army, standing against thousands, or a mastermind tactician controlling the battlefield?",
